  "text": "Service: GitHub\nIncident: Degraded availability for GitHub Actions, GitHub Pages and Webhooks\nStatus: resolved\nImpact: critical\nStarted: 2026-10-19T15:49:25.822Z\nResolved: 2026-10-19T16:56:58.390Z\nUpdates:\n- 2026-10-19T16:56:58.390Z: resolved - This incident has been resolved. Thank you for your patience and understanding as we addressed this issue. A detailed root cause analysis will be shared as soon as it is available.\n- 2026-10-19T16:56:54.747Z: monitoring - Actions, Pages and Webhooks are operating normally.\n- 2026-10-19T16:30:29.644Z: investigating - We’re seeing recovery following mitigation and are continuing to monitor. Customers may still experience delays in GitHub Actions workflow status updates, GitHub Pages deployments, and check and workflow webhook events generated by Actions runs.\n- 2026-10-19T15:56:34.098Z: investigating - We’re are currently investigating degraded availability affecting GitHub Actions, GitHub Pages and Webhooks. Customers may experience delays in workflow processing, site builds and webhook delivery. \n- 2026-10-19T15:50:10.810Z: investigating - Webhooks is experiencing degraded performance. We are continuing to investigate.\n- 2026-10-19T15:49:25.946Z: investigating - We are investigating reports of degraded performance for Actions and Pages",
